response:
```js
function debounce(fn, ms) {
    let timer;
    return (...args) => {
        clearTimeout(timer);
        timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), ms);
    };
}
```

The wrapped function runs only after `ms` milliseconds have passed with no further calls, using the arguments of the last call.

